---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import ContactStrip from '../../../components/ContactStrip.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Training"
  description="Factory and on-site training from Sector Technology — classroom and hands-on machine training covering operation, software, and maintenance, standard or custom-tailored."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Services"
    title="Training"
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Services' }, { label: 'Training' }]}
    intro="Factory training or on-site training with one of our service engineers."
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-steel-700">
          We offer both factory training and on-site training with one of our service engineers.
          Sector Technology has lab machines equipped with every process, used specifically for
          training customers. We offer both classroom training and machine training that covers
          the full range of cutting techniques — a great option for sending operators and
          programmers to the factory for additional training to increase productivity and decrease
          operating costs.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-steel-700">
          If you can't afford the time to send employees to the factory, we also offer additional
          on-site training on your machine. We have a standard curriculum, but we can custom-tailor
          training to meet your specific needs. In addition to operational training, we also offer
          both software training and maintenance training.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy-950">Related</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/services/technical-service/" class="rounded-md border border-brand-steel-300 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-brand-navy-950 hover:bg-brand-steel-100">Technical Service</a></li>
          <li><a href="/services/retrofits/" class="rounded-md border border-brand-steel-300 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-brand-navy-950 hover:bg-brand-steel-100">Retrofits</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <aside>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-brand-steel-200 bg-brand-steel-100 p-6">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-steel-700">Schedule training</h2>
          <div class="mt-3">
            <ContactStrip email="support@sectortechnologyinc.com" label="Email" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand
    title="Want to train your operators or programmers?"
    body="Ask about factory training, on-site training, or a custom curriculum for your team."
    ctaLabel="Contact Us"
    ctaHref="/contact/"
  />
</Layout>
